    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AUTOGRIP Machinery Co., Ltd. has been dedicated to delivering high-precision, high-rigidity workholding solutions since 1989. With a foundation built on 35 years of experience, the company is fully integrated into Industry 4.0, offering a comprehensive range of products designed and manufactured in Taiwan. Our focus is on providing reliable, innovative, and efficient solutions for machining centers, turning centers, and special purpose machines.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
